ough evidence-based practices.", "ZALOGA GPL:Zaloga GPL is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in the context of acute pancreatitis. He has collaborated on a meta-analysis that examines various nutrition methods applicable to this condition, as well as contributing to multiple studies focused on nutritional interventions in acute pancreatitis. His work highlights the importance of nutrition in managing this medical condition.", "WINDSOR AC:Windsor AC is an author who has conducted research on the effects of enteral feeding in acute pancreatitis. Through their studies, Windsor AC has contributed to the understanding of how enteral feeding impacts patients suffering from this condition.", "KANWAR S:Kanwar S is an author who contributed to the study comparing enteral and parenteral nutrition in acute pancreatitis."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}